# Mavuika Citlali Rosaria Xilonen. ~18s Rot. Mavuika double Cryo Melt. Mavuika Q 6[C2D] C2, Q C13 is -13K DPS. Rosaria goes after Citlali for better Cryo uptime, Full EM Evenstar Citlali, no TTDS to Mavuika. Xilonen does not burst.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
mavuika char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
mavuika add weapon="mailedflower" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#mavuika add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
mavuika add set="oc" count=4;
